      "writtenOn": "2026-03-03T01:58:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In enqueue_task_rt(), when a RT task (woken_rt) is woken up synchronously, it is not added to the pushable queue. If another RT task (running_rt) keeps occupying the CPU for an extended period, woken_rt remains runnable but is never considered for RT push balancing. This may result in prolonged starvation under sustained RT load.",
      "parentUuid": "a16c8c79_0a2b24f9",
      "revId": "07eed740ddcd242ddd2a3f6607f6215bba664beb",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
